  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, there are the following assembly dependencies in the udon libraries: VRC.Udon.VM -> VRC.Udon.Wrapper -> UnityEngine.*\nWhen developing compilers for udon, it would be helpful to be able to actually execute code against the udon VM without having to run in the unity editor. This could be achieved more easily if the wrappers were split into one assembly for .NET core classes and one for unity types, and allowing the VM to be instantiated using only the .NET core class wrappers.",
